# App config. Copy the lines you need into app/.env.local (gitignored), then
# restart `npm run web`. IMPORTANT: everything with the EXPO_PUBLIC_ prefix is
# BUNDLED INTO THE APP and visible to anyone who uses it — put ONLY non-secret,
# restrictable values here (never a Google server key). See docs/maps-setup.md.

# --- Map basemap (OPTIONAL) ---
# The map renders KEYLESS by default (OpenStreetMap raster, darkened to night).
# For the cinematic dark VECTOR look, pick ONE:
#
#   EASIEST — Protomaps, self-hosted ($0, NO key): host just the .pmtiles file
#   and set its URL here. The Wayfare dark vector style is bundled in the app
#   (src/components/wayfare/protomaps-dark.ts) and built around it automatically.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_PMTILES_URL=https://yourhost.com/wayfare-manila.pmtiles
#
#   OR a full style.json URL (self-hosted, or MapTiler — restrict a MapTiler key
#   by domain in their dashboard). Takes precedence over PMTILES_URL if both set.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_MAP_STYLE_URL=https://api.maptiler.com/maps/streets-v2-dark/style.json?key=YOUR_MAPTILER_KEY

# --- Walking-route server (OPTIONAL, no key) ---
# Real walking routes use the free public OSRM demo by default. Point this at a
# self-hosted OSRM for production reliability.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_OSRM_URL=https://router.project-osrm.org

# --- API base (OPTIONAL) ---
# The app auto-detects the server (localhost on web, LAN IP on device). Override:
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:4100
